"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1320230/extras/28561cd963e3df49e102a79a8ac96963.poster.avif?t=1636412486\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1320230/extras/28561cd963e3df49e102a79a8ac96963.webm?t=1636412486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1320230/extras/28561cd963e3df49e102a79a8ac96963.mp4?t=1636412486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
